<title>NORWAY: TABLE-Nera H1 pre-tax profits rise 18 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Nera H1 pre-tax profits rise 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>				 (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Operating revenues	  1,305	vs	1,166</p>
<p>  Operating profit		 75	vs	   71</p>
<p>  Pre-tax profit		   66	vs	   56</p>
<p>  Net profit			 50	vs	   42</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of Norwegian telecommunications company is Nera ASA. A Reuters poll of eight analysts forecast a second-quarter operating result of 34 million crowns and pre-tax profits of 28 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
